SUMMARY:Bowditch Representations in Hyperbolic Spaces
DESCRIPTION:Bowditch\, followed by Tan-Wong-Zhang\, introduced in 1998 a cl
 ass of representations of the once-punctured torus group into PSL(2\,C). U
 sing trace relations in PSL(2\,C)\, they give a condition on a representat
 ion which ensures that the translation lengths of the images of simple clo
 sed curves grow linearly with respect to the word length. In this talk\, I
  will explain how to define and study a…\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/ev
