SUMMARY:Around a Conjecture of Michel Duflo
DESCRIPTION:The Duflo polynomial conjecture establishes a connection betwee
 n two different mathematical worlds: classical Poisson geometry and the al
 gebra of invariant differential operators associated with representations 
 of Lie groups. It generalizes the classical Duflo isomorphism\, which rela
 tes the center of a universal enveloping algebra to the Poisson center of 
